WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:05.083
Invite someone to your book

2
00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:12.810
Invite people to work on a book with you. Each person gets one of three roles.

3
00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:17.952
Choose the book and type their email.

4
00:00:17.955 --> 00:00:33.834
A co-writer writes with you live. An editor's changes arrive as tracked changes. A commenter only leaves notes.

5
00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:39.450
They get an email with a link. Collaborators are free and only see the books you share.
